# Build context filter for dist/docker/Dockerfile.
# Read by `docker build` and, when no .containerignore exists, by
# `podman build`/buildah too - so this one file covers both engines.
#
# The image copies exactly one file (dist/docker/entrypoint.sh) and clones the
# sources itself at run time, so everything else - .git alone is ~180 MB, plus
# build/, lib/ and tools/node_modules - is pure upload cost. Exclude the tree
# and re-admit that single file, one directory level at a time (the safe form:
# a `!` pattern cannot resurrect a file whose parent directory is excluded).
*
!dist
dist/*
!dist/docker
dist/docker/*
!dist/docker/entrypoint.sh
